# Nova Fox wiki — instance environment (the live file is
# ~/nova-fox-wiki/oauth.env on awsbox, mode 0600, never in git).
PHEXT_PUBLIC_URL=https://fox.phext.io
PHEXT_SESSION_SECRET=<fill: the instance's own session secret>
PHEXT_COOKIE_SECURE=1
# Sign-in: phext.tech SSO. The wiki holds no provider keys of its
# own — it is a consumer of phext.tech, registered there under
# the audience below; phext.tech's own sign-in (GitHub, Google,
# or X) does the rest, and the sealed assertion lands on
# /api/auth/callback. PHEXT_SSO_SECRET is the shared SSO key the
# assertions are opened with; its value arrives only via the
# launch runbook's handoff (file to file, never printed, never
# in git). The provider URL defaults to https://phext.tech.
PHEXT_SSO_AUDIENCE=novafoxwiki
#PHEXT_SSO_PROVIDER_URL=https://phext.tech
PHEXT_SSO_SECRET=
